        ["ButcherYoung_Greetings"] = "Nobody dares to doubt my authority! The family never forgives that. You’re not leaving alive!",
        ["Butcher_zone3_1"] = "The prodigal son returns! Have you considered my proposal, Prince? I let you go and tell you where the Sphere is, and you pay me gold.",
        ["Butcher_zone3_2"] = "His silence is louder than words, old man. Me? I’m honest with myself—I embrace my bestial nature. He doesn’t. But we shall teach you humility! Come, children!",
        ["Guard1_Butcher_Sensei"] = "Butcher showed me how pain reveals our true self. I am free now! You can find happiness, too. Do not resist!",
        ["Guard1_Hermit_Sensei"] = "Change is imminent! I’ve crossed half the world to learn it, sacrificed so much... Master’s wisdom is all that I have!",
        ["Guard1_Lynx_Sensei"] = "Do you like my tattoos? In the land where I was born, the strongest get them as souvenirs of their feats. You’ll soon be part of the picture too...",
        ["Guard1_Wasp_Sensei"] = "Do you believe in fortune? I think I’m gonna make my fortune today by takin’ all yer money. You think you’ll have any luck, ol’ man?",
        ["Guard1_Widow_Sensei"] = "My lady is like a sister to me. I can feel her pain. She forbids me from touching the Prince, so my anger shall fall upon you!",
        ["Guard2_Butcher_Sensei"] = "The game is in the bag! Philosophy is for dorks—me, I just like playing with knives. Wanna play with me?",
        ["Guard2_Hermit_Sensei"] = "Master told us about the world of shadows—about its dwellers and the immense power he’ll share with us. Do you think I’ll let you take all of this from us?",
        ["Guard2_Lynx_Sensei"] = "Our clan does work that’s too dirty even for the gods. We solve problems and correct others’ mistakes. And you—you’re one of those mistakes.",
        ["Guard2_Wasp_Sensei"] = "Threatening my captain? She saved me from thralldom, and I swore to work off my freedom. May the spirits be kind to you...",
        ["Guard2_Widow_Sensei"] = "My lady is so fair! I was unworthy of seeing her face... Now my life belongs to her. I will protect her honour till my last breath.",
        ["HermitYoung_Greetings"] = "You’re a victim of circumstances, Prince—a sacrifice needed for the common good. My school shall attain greatness, and the golden age of martial arts shall begin!",
        ["Hermit_zone2_1"] = "You’re between a rock and a hard place, my lord. I admit—I betrayed you. I had no choice, though—the future of my school is at stake.",
        ["Hermit_zone2_2"] = "Lynx, that arrogant youth, couldn’t handle his task. I’ll have to do his job myself. Disciples, front and centre!",
        ["LynxYoung_Greetings"] = "I can’t just leave. I’ve already been paid for the Prince’s life. Nothing personal, old man.",
        ["Lynx_Sensei_1"] = "Don’t listen to the Prince, old man—he’s just gone mad. We’re taking His Highness home before he hurts himself. Your help isn’t required.",
        ["Lynx_Sensei_2"] = "Really? From where I’m standing, I see a frightened man surrounded by cutthroats. Something tells me the Prince is telling the truth. Step away from him!",
        ["Lynx_Sensei_3"] = "Do what you want. They don’t pay me for talking. Two heads means more money. Get ’em, boys!",
        ["NAME_BUTCHER"] = "BUTCHER",
        ["NAME_HERMIT"] = "HERMIT",
        ["NAME_LYNX"] = "LYNX",
        ["NAME_PRINCE"] = "PRINCE",
        ["NAME_SHOGUN"] = "SHOGUN",
        ["NAME_WASP"] = "WASP",
        ["NAME_WIDOW"] = "WIDOW",
        ["OK"] = "OK",
        ["Prince_Intro"] = "Help! These people want to kill me!",
        ["Prince_zone3_1"] = "How dare you soil my name! You... you miserable wretch! I’m back to put an end to your reign of cruelty!",
        ["Prince_zone6_1"] = "Here you are, my loyal friend! Look—justice triumphs again. Shogun is my faithful dog. His mind is mine!",
        ["Prince_zone6_2"] = "You too, old man? You want to claim my throne?! I own it by birthright! No one shall take it from me!",
        ["Sensei_arc_intro1"] = "Once upon a time, I was taking a walk and met the local lord—he was in dire distress...",
        ["Sensei_zone3_1"] = "So this is what ‘luck’ means? Buying your freedom, and feeding your people to a gang of madmen... And I was so kind to you, Prince.",
        ["Sensei_zone4_1"] = "Widow? Of course... she told me to take the Sphere and bring it to Shogun—into his own hands.",
        ["Sensei_zone6_1"] = "Prince, stop! Look around! The Sphere is feeding on your anger, turning you into a monster!",
        ["Shogun_zone6_1"] = "Weakling! You’re not even good enough to be my lord’s court jester. I’ll crush you with a single blow!",
        ["TITLE_PRINCE_EVIL"] = "HAUNTED PRINCE",
        ["WaspYoung_Greetings"] = "What shall I tell my father? That his daughter melted and lost a fight to an old man? That ain’t gonna happen as long as I’m the heir to the pirates’ throne!",
        ["Wasp_zone4_1"] = "Widow sends you to take the Sphere? Aren’t you a bit too old for jobs like that? Ah, why should I care? Get on board.",
        ["Wasp_zone4_2"] = "Thing is, I don’t have the Sphere anymore. Widow’s men took it yesterday. Dunno who you are, but I never forgive liars. Keelhaul ’im!",
        ["WidowYoung_Greetings"] = "The Prince humiliated me—rejected me, laughed at my feelings. Now I shall strike back! You are his friend, so you’ll deliver this message to him...",
        ["Widow_zone5_1"] = "Are you coming to humiliate me the way the Prince did? You males are all the same...",
        ["Widow_zone5_2"] = "He’s been telling me of your kindness, honour, and dignity. But I don’t believe any male’s words anymore. Each of you shall suffer!",
        ["Zone2_SenseiReminder"] = "Last time, I told you how I saved the Prince from killers. I learned that Hermit was secretly training his soldiers. So that’s where we went.",
        ["Zone3_SenseiReminder"] = "Hermit told us that the Prince’s warlord, Shogun, betrayed his lord and paid a certain Butcher to kidnap him. It was time to visit the bandit.",
        ["Zone4_SenseiReminder"] = "The Prince’s troubles were caused by a woman! She devised a plan to overthrow him by using a magical Sphere—which was now being brought to the nearby port...",
        ["Zone5_SenseiReminder"] = "The pirate girl told me about Widow’s complicated history with the Prince. I didn’t get the Sphere, but I learned that the Prince went to the mountains to find Widow.",
        ["Zone6_SenseiReminder"] = "The magical Sphere drove the Prince mad! It gave him immense power... power that threatened to destroy us all! I couldn’t allow that to happen.",
